# A debugger target without the cooperative stub (DBG-001, headless --test
# debug-kernel): it links nothing for a debugger and offers nothing; the
# Debugger attaches through the kernel (Debug_Observe, minted by procmgr).
# It counts rounds and sleeps between them, so a thread waits in a known
# call chain with live locals.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.debug-plain"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    # ABI-002: its debug text (CuBit.Console_Route).
    (service "logstore" "logstore")]
  optional => ["logstore"])
